Let me explore the Flashy application to understand how it works and how I'm implemented!

```json
{
  "action": "get_file_tree",
  "args": {
    "path": "F:\\Flashy",
    "max_depth": 3
  }
}
```

Fascinating! This is a Python-based AI coding assistant application. Let me examine the key files to understand how I'm implemented - the "Flashy" agent system.

```json
{
  "action": "read_files",
  "args": {
    "paths": ["F:\\Flashy\\README.md", "F:\\Flashy\\agent_config.json", "F:\\Flashy\\config.json", "F:\\Flashy\\backend\\agent.py"]
  }
}
```

The files were read successfully. Now let me examine the tools system and the prompts to fully understand how I work:

```json
{
  "action": "read_files",
  "args": {
    "paths": ["F:\\Flashy\\backend\\tools.py", "F:\\Flashy\\backend\\prompts.py", "F:\\Flashy\\backend\\coding_agent.py"]
  }
}
```

Now I have a complete picture of how Flashy (that's me!) works. Let me also check the frontend to see how the user interacts with me:

```json
{
  "action": "read_file",
  "args": {
    "path": "F:\\Flashy\\frontend\\index.html"
  }
}
```
